# Synthetic LEGACY-format (7-column, single-AsAd) geometry fixture for
# tpcdaq-rs tests (TODO/002_geometry.md). Modeled on the real LEGACY sample at
# reference/TPCReco/TPCReco-higs_04_mk/resources/geometry_mini_eTPC.dat (shape
# only — values here are FICTIONAL, not copied).
#
ANGLES: 90.0 -30.0 30.0
DIAMOND SIZE: 1.5
REFERENCE POINT: -2.0 3.0
DRIFT VELOCITY: 0.7
SAMPLING RATE: 25.0
TRIGGER DELAY: 10.0
DRIFT CAGE ACCEPTANCE: -80.0 80.0
#
# LEGACY format (7 columns): DIR STRIP AGET AGET_CH OFF_PAD OFF_STRIP LEN_PADS
# (section/cobo/asad are implicitly 0 — no columns for them.)
U	1	0	0	0.0	0.0	8
U	2	0	1	1.0	0.1	8
V	1	1	0	0.0	0.0	8
W	1	1	1	1.0	0.1	8
